"""Bounded multi-step actions. No command, shell, path or environment input.

Install root-owned as /usr/lib/sysknife/action-steps. Each sudoers grant names
one operation; this helper validates its entire argument grammar independently.
User operations drop all root credentials before touching a home or invoking a
user-configurable tool. Never add a generic exec mode or a caller-selected path.
"""
